    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24623" root="صقل" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَقِيلٌ</span></b>  A thing, (M,) or a sword, (Msb,) [and
the like,] <i>Polished;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَصْقُولٌ</span></b> . (M, Msb,
K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And A thing, such as iron, and copper,
<i>smooth, solid, and impenetrable to water.</i> (Msb.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [Also, as a subst., implying the meaning of an
epithet,] <i>A sword.</i> (S, TA.)

